[00:20.44]We thank you, Jehovah, each day and each night,
[00:31.94]That you shed upon us your precious light.
[00:43.76]We thank you that we have the priv’lege of prayer,
[00:54.88]That we can approach you with ev’ry care.
[01:16.66]We thank you, Jehovah, for your loving Son,
[01:25.50]Who conquered the world; by his faith he won.
[01:36.62]We thank you for guidance in doing your will.
[01:48.28]You lovingly help us our vows fulfill.
[02:16.70]We thank you, our God, for the honor to preach
[02:26.10]About your great name and the truth to teach.
[02:39.15]We thank you that soon all earth’s woes will be past,
[02:50.86]While your Kingdom blessings forever last.
